    "collapsible_content_nJrYmE": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "faq_1": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "How is this different from doing Kegels on my own?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Many men struggle with consistency because the routine feels vague. [product_title] gives you a more structured, device-led way to build a repeatable home habit.</p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "faq_2": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "Is this a medical treatment?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>No. This is an at-home wellness routine meant to support consistency and comfort. It is not a substitute for medical diagnosis or treatment. If you have specific concerns, speak with a qualified clinician.</p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "faq_3": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "Who is this trainer designed for?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>This product is positioned for men who want a private at-home pelvic floor training routine with guided modes and rechargeable convenience.</p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "faq_4": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "How often should I use it?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>The strongest results usually come from consistency, not marathon sessions. A simple, repeatable rhythm tends to be easier to maintain than an all-or-nothing plan.</p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "faq_5": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "Is it rechargeable?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Yes. It uses Type-C charging, so it is easy to power up and keep ready for regular sessions at home.</p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "faq_6": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "Will it be discreet?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Yes. The device is intended for private home use, and discreet shipping helps reduce extra friction when getting started.</p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "faq_7": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "What if it does not feel like the right fit for me?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Start with the promise that you are simply testing consistency, not chasing perfection. If it does not feel aligned with your routine, you have a 30-day confidence promise to lean on.</p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        }
      },
